109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 35 0 R
/E (The K K Wagh Arts, Commerce, Science and Computer Science College, popularly known as K K Wagh Senior College, was established in July 2002. The college is affiliated with Savitribai Phule Pune University, Pune, and is accredited by NAAC. The college campus is housed in its own building and offers a pleasant natural and scenic environment. It provides full-fledged undergraduate and postgraduate degree courses in Arts, Commerce, Science, and Computer Science. In response to modern educational trends, the college has introduced professional courses such as B.B.A., B.C.A., Cyber and Digital Science, Biotechnology, M.Com., and M.Sc. programs in Analytical Chemistry, Microbiology, Biotechnology, and Computer Science. The institution is known for its academic excellence, disciplined environment, and effective administration.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
110 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 35 0 R
/E ( The Department of Computer Science, established in 2002, has been consistently committed to providing quality education and fostering technical excellence among students. The department currently offers B.Sc. Computer Science with 2 divisions and a total intake capacity of 160 students, M.Sc. Computer Science with 2 divisions and an intake of 60 students, and Cyber & Digital Science with 1 division and an intake of 60 students. The department focuses on building strong theoretical foundations along with practical skills in emerging technologies, preparing students for careers in IT, research, and higher education. With well-qualified faculty, modern infrastructure, and a student-centric approach, the department strives to promote innovation, critical thinking, and overall professional development.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
